  THAT IS A REAL REFUSAL AND IT IS EXPENSIVE FOR THE TEXTBOOK. Reciprocal
  inhibition plus spike-triggered adaptation is the half-center, both
  ingredients are now present and individually verified live, and the two
  populations still do not alternate. So what is missing is not a component
